    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/listening-01.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/listening-01.wav",
      "script": "えんぴつを、さんぼんください。かみを、にまいください。ほんは、かいません。",
      "sha256": "ad439e37834e44b9b8e73c873e664e4566867c2c545581501056ec9b3a5afc0c",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/listening-02.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/listening-02.wav",
      "script": "りんごは、みっつです。パンは、ふたつです。パンをふたつください。",
      "sha256": "6f83f54674d8e493226a2ea32f66ce4f57b65de58c771b0c94444f264b42bc0a",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/listening-03.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/listening-03.wav",
      "script": "このノートは、ひゃくえんです。ペンは、せんえんです。ノートをかいます。",
      "sha256": "2ddf3cc729c2b979a2bd9abba9914c58e4f4c4649f06199f8eaeead27cde8a58",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/listening-04.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/listening-04.wav",
      "script": "わたしは、ほんをにさつかいます。あねは、ほんをいっさつかいます。",
      "sha256": "d734f53448ed0786ac70dea24e5a0b25fad2e6f5d923e1a42555fac507250377",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/listening-05.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/listening-05.wav",
      "script": "かずをつたえます。いちばん。りんごをみっつください。にばん。りんごをひとつください。さんばん。りんごをよっつください。よんばん。りんごをふたつください。",
      "sha256": "3b9af4fce6c20590309b7dd0f8d15ddc5fd4d01f8fa91b23fe6773aa9e0d7e3a",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/listening-06.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/listening-06.wav",
      "script": "いくらですか。",
      "sha256": "9d43fb9df2d94bfbd94686d6e719d7f51fd4015b187d7ca936567ed98e212987",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-1.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-1.wav",
      "script": "かう。うる。てんいん。きゃく。いくら。",
      "sha256": "f7e910e581b81e126aabe6d2ff00037590e2f4a651f4fb91221f148658cf3add",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-2.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-2.wav",
      "script": "いくつ。えん。ひゃく。せん。おつり。",
      "sha256": "d7ce4c798d93f758d02760c838c200d2613faec1ff1c1b59fde3f2aab498e5de",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-3.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-3.wav",
      "script": "さいふ。ふくろ。レジ。おかね。ひとつ。",
      "sha256": "af42ffc380064e1e28d7bab2ac4ace1980b97da4f02a88efa66654cac1e9b539",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-4.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-4.wav",
      "script": "ふたつ。みっつ。よっつ。いつつ。むっつ。",
      "sha256": "8f5b7809781b184821259182d6a3702c13a50f7a65b85b6451f400286733ca3e",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-5.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-words-5.wav",
      "script": "ななつ。やっつ。ここのつ。とお。ぜんぶ。",
      "sha256": "d721dd8426c6407f3b812e2c235fbd4389a95b027650d73928285e63831872d6",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-kanji.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-kanji.wav",
      "script": "いち。に。さん。よん。ご。ひとつ。いっぽん。よんまい。よんさつ。",
      "sha256": "5c79950f65707a837e0d30a782495555e993cf7f92ed8bd16c78c3107de1f3da",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-G19.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-G19.wav",
      "script": "りんごをみっつください。パンをふたつください。ひとつ、ふたつ、みっつ、よっつ、いつつ、むっつ、ななつ、やっつ、ここのつ、とお。",
      "sha256": "c0ef910b1744dd7f3f48508dcec5b2f418ab8eacdb1cf2d3cea5285d5746fdee",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-G20.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-G20.wav",
      "script": "えんぴつは、いっぽん、にほん、さんぼん、よんほん、ごほん、ろっぽん、ななほん、はっぽん、きゅうほん、じゅっぽん。かみは、いちまい、にまい、さんまい。ほんは、いっさつ、にさつ、さんさつ、はっさつ、じゅっさつ。",
      "sha256": "e23687e2ea01ec4bcfc31604ca12ceebbde3fd3b7fe21240354b08c5645fcd97",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-G21.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-G21.wav",
      "script": "いくらですか。ひゃくえんです。いくつですか。ふたつです。ぜんぶでひゃくえんです。",
      "sha256": "6110549dd0c2e30969e95d8682991fbd1a59b58f129b7a79c446a5b91381178a",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
      "reviewedAt": null
    },
    {
      "id": "audio:/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-context.wav",
      "kind": "audio",
      "src": "/assets/audio/u07/U07-teach-context.wav",
      "script": "パンはふたつ、ねだんはひゃくえんです。もの、かず、ねだんをたしかめましょう。",
      "sha256": "f980f6bd9d99cdc57b159625b27ee3305ac027267f64949177f8b123015890dd",
      "status": "NOT_RUN",
      "reviewer": null,
